	(text "Blue-Pill compatible headers, 2x 1x20, 2.54 mm, row spacing 15.24 mm. Shipped loose (DNP for assembly).\nHeader_A: PB12 PB13 PB14 PB15 PA8 PA9 PA10 PA11 PA12 PA15 SWO PB4 PB5 I2C_SCL I2C_SDA PB8 PB9 +5V GND +3V3\nHeader_B: VBAT PC13 PC14 PC15 PA0 PA1 PA2 PA3 PA4 PA5 PA6 PA7 PB0 PB1 PB10 PB11 NRST +3V3 GND GND\nQwiic (JST-SH): 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA (PB7), 4 SCL (PB6). 4.7k pull-ups, cut JP to remove.\nCortex-Debug 10-pin: VTref, SWDIO (PA13), SWCLK (PA14), SWO (PB3), nRESET. SWD 1x4: 3V3 SWDIO SWCLK GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
